ic Headwear: This is the helmet of the Borderlands Warrior set.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The cosmetic helm has a distinct look for <a href=\"/page/Dragonborn\" title=\"Dragonborn\">Dragonborn</a>.\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Borderlands_Warrior_Helm_on_Dragonborn.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Borderlands_Warrior_Helm_on_Dragonborn.jpg/300px-Borderlands_Warrior_Helm_on_Dragonborn.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"292\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Borderlands_Warrior_Helm_on_Dragonborn.jpg/450px-Borderlands_Warrior_Helm_on_Dragonborn.jpg 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/Borderlands_Warrior_Helm_on_Dragonborn.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201341\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.106 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3129/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17831/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3742/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 15/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n141.33%  126.842     36 Template:IO\n100.00%   89.746      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   89.746      1 -total\n 97.06%   87.110      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 47.45%   42.584      2 Temp